  "notes": "{巻|ま}く means to wind, wrap, or roll something around.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nType: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦マフラー→マフラー：04533_mafuraa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{首|くび}→首：00792_kubi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{巻|ま}く: to wrap a scarf around one's neck\n- ⟦{包帯|ほうたい}→包帯：05385_houtai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{巻|ま}く: to wrap a bandage\n- ⟦{袖|そで}→袖：02217_sode⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{巻|ま}く: to roll up sleeves\n\nCOMPOUND VERBS:\n- ⟦{巻|ま}き{込|こ}む→巻き込む：05753_makikomu⟧: to involve, drag into\n- ⟦{巻|ま}き{戻|もど}す→巻き戻す：15915_makimodosu⟧: to rewind\n- ⟦{巻|ま}き{上|あ}げる→巻き上げる：20304_makiageru⟧: to roll up\n\nDON'T CONFUSE (all まく):\n- {巻|ま}く: to wind, wrap\n- ⟦{蒔|ま}く→蒔く：02419_maku⟧: to sow (seeds)\n- ⟦{撒|ま}く→撒く：12711_maku⟧: to scatter",
